 A single key (or array of keys) that should be parsed as `Boolean`s.
 
+#### options.count
+Type: `Array|String`<br>
+Default: `[]`
+
+A single key (or array of keys) whose value is the number of times the flag was given. Counted flags never consume a value, so `-vvv` yields `{ v: 3 }` and `--verbose --verbose` yields `{ verbose: 2 }`. Aliases share a single count, and `--no-<key>` resets it to `0`.
+
 #### options.default
 Type: `Object`<br>
 Default: `{}`
